  "correction_rules": [
    "Adjust forecasts downward when sentiment is neutral or negative, especially after recent spikes.",
    "Reduce forecast overshoots by 10-15% in the immediate post-spike period.",
    "Apply mean reversion bias: if forecast is > 10% above recent 7-day average, reduce by 5-8%.",
    "Increase forecast sensitivity to sentiment shifts: if sentiment turns positive, raise forecast by 3-5%.",
    "Correct for lag: if true outcome is > 2% above forecast 3-5 days later, adjust forecast upward by 1-2% for next period.",
    "Avoid overreacting to short-term volatility: if history shows high noise, use 30-day moving average as baseline for correction."
  ]
